					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2291020#post-4258970</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-2291020/daveyoufool-s-proposal#post-4258970</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 23 May 2019 21:06:58 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>silverpanther17</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5048558</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I like this <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">001</span> OO1-J particularly over the others because the emphasis is drawn away from what OO1-J is, opting to lampoon containment/breach porn entries instead. &quot;The description of SCP-OO1-J is a lethal cognitohazard&quot; informs of this immediately, and &quot;and as such, is available on request for all interested personnel&quot; plays off that fact with even more humor.</p> <p>But Schubert-9 is made the star of this article and plays the part excellently. It's difficult for a table to iteratively tell a narrative, but it's much more difficult for a table to build up a joke that continuously delivers humor. The addendum works very well to bring The Universe back into the piece's scope, and not even the addendum rollover text is wasted with yet another joke.</p> <p>There's just so much I enjoy about this -J entry, I'd be ranting if I continued pointing out why I do so. +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
